    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a \"journey\" or a \"challenge\" to me. it's just... the same pain every time. i look at my life and i see nothing but this cycle. i feel like i'm just taking up space and making things harder for everyone around me by constantly letting them down. if i could just stop the noise, maybe it would all be better.",
